WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:04.630
One incorrect detail can become an expensive decision.

2
00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:08.670
An AI agent prepares an order from a supplier quote.

3
00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:13.550
But what if the price or revision is wrong?

4
00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:17.690
VERIFAI asks where every important fact came from.

5
00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:21.110
It compares the proposed action with its evidence.

6
00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:25.260
Unsupported details are flagged, not invented.

7
00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:28.270
A person decides what happens next.

8
00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:34.260
VERIFAI. Research toward more accountable AI decisions.

